OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at Port of Dover as
OL,4,Amasked men hold protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been major disruption at the
OL,7,FPort of Dover due to a large group of
OL,8,Fmasked men holding a demonstration.
OL,10,FHundreds of protesters, dressed in
OL,11,Fblack and wearing face coverings,
OL,12,Fblocked roads and were heard chanting
OL,13,F"stop the boats".
OL,15,FKent Police said it had been "engaging
OL,16,Fwith protesters" and marched the crowd
OL,17,Fto Dover Priory railway station at
OL,18,Fabout 11:30 BST. After that, people
OL,19,Fstarted to disperse.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
