OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at Port of Dover as
OL,4,Amasked men hold protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic was initially stopped from
OL,7,Fgoing in and out of the port but
OL,8,Fofficials said approach roads were now
OL,9,F"free flowing".
